#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:10 454ea56d651d490691582adce1eaa78b
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:12 1ae5a1dfe45a46dc9be0819077f861df
msgid ""
"Plane has a wide range of built in flight modes. Plane can act as a simple "
"flight stabilization system, a sophisticated autopilot, a training system or"
" a flight safety system depending on what flight mode and options you "
"choose."
msgstr "Plane 内置了多种飞行模式，可根据所选飞行模式和选项，用作简单的飞行稳定系统、复杂的飞控系统、训练系统或飞行安全系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:17 26254605bf9442a49e54c2aae9c00822
msgid ""
"Flight modes are controlled through a :ref:`radio transmitter switch "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`, via mission commands, or"
" using commands from a ground station (GCS) or companion computer."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式可通过 :ref:`遥控器开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` "
"、任务命令或来自地面站（GCS）或伴侣计算机的命令进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:22 4a6cfc4b972e42edbd51b000bdc832f0
msgid "Major Flight Modes"
msgstr "主要飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:24 6b9702e5961e4427bb3ec1ffeed0b242
msgid ""
"All of the flight modes below have optional additional controls that may be "
"used to change the behaviour to suit particular flying needs. After you have"
" read the introductory material below it is highly recommended that you look"
" through the complete set of :doc:`Plane parameters <parameters>` so you can"
" explore the full range of functionality available."
msgstr ""
"以下所有飞行模式均有可选的附加控制项，可用于针对特定飞行需求调整行为。阅读以下介绍材料后，强烈建议查阅完整的 :doc:`Plane 参数 "
"<parameters>` 集，以探索全部可用功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:63 a59d91d012644fd497caed55acf17b80
msgid ""
"Automatic throttle controlled modes can optionally have pilot-based speed "
"adjustments using the throttle stick via the "
":ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` parameter. Otherwise, the autopilot "
"will attempt to maintain :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` airspeed if"
" an airspeed sensor is being used, or :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` as"
" a target throttle, as in FBWA and CRUISE modes."
msgstr ""
"自动油门控制模式可通过 :ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` "
"参数选择性地允许飞手用油门摇杆调整速度。否则，飞控将在使用空速传感器时尝试维持 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 空速，或如 FBWA 和 CRUISE 模式中，以 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 作为目标油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:65 206e957a8fda4e6fb9b157fccf337dd1
msgid ""
"Most altitude controlled modes can optionally maintain altitude with respect"
" to Terrain instead of relative to HOME. See :ref:`common-terrain-following`"
" for more information."
msgstr ""
"大多数高度控制模式可选择相对于地形而非相对于 Home 点来维持高度。详见 :ref:`common-terrain-following`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:70 c19317bad303464587d6b2bdbebd27e9
msgid ""
"Any stabilized control mode requires tuning for optimal performance. The "
"default PID and TECS values are very conservative to avoid uncontrollable "
"oscillations. Perform an :ref:`AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` "
"before using stabilized or automatic roll and pitch modes extensively. "
":ref:`Tune TECS <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-"
"guide>` before using automatic throttle modes extensively."
msgstr ""
"任何稳定控制模式都需要调参以获得最优性能。默认的 PID 和 TECS 值非常保守，以避免不可控的震荡。在大量使用稳定或自动横滚俯仰模式之前，请先执行 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>`。在大量使用自动油门模式之前，请先 :ref:`调整 "
"TECS <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:76 f55fda1c663c4f40ad05aef911bef7ae
msgid ""
"AUTO mode also provides for :ref:`automatic-takeoff` and :ref:`automatic-"
"landing`."
msgstr "AUTO 模式还支持 :ref:`automatic-takeoff` 和 :ref:`automatic-landing`。"

